{arial}from: {arialbld}Kurt Rorscham{arial}

Liverpool Naval Base










So {name}, 'ya still riding camels?

Alex Kolman was looking for a nanny to take care of you, so here I am - with the 4th Schyzo army, we're based at {arialbld}Liverpool,{arial} the weather is filthy.{pause}

So if you're in this, you got wrapped up by the old bag too. This campaign won't exactly be what you might call "a little job"...

We have to relocate some 3 million Psycho squatters armed with 88s and take them back home all across the Eustral countries, from west to east, over some 3000 km. First stop is Fromance.{pause}

They should have warned you, it's gonna rock! This will be the most important landing ever undertaken in the navy's history.{pause} 

I'm looking at the details of your landing fleet, cripes! I see you've got enough transportation to board the entire cast of the Barzum Circus, including your racing camels' stables!{pause}











{center}{device25}












Guess who's waiting for us on the other side!{pause}
{pause}
{ia6}{offset100}{ia5}{offset200}{ia4}{offset0}













{pause}Once again it's our job to spank the Archduke's ill-mannered juniors. Stop clapping your hands, it's far from being won. The Tekton brothers are eager to avenge their clobbering in Jaffar, this time they have hardened troops...


{arialbld}Let's talk business now:{arial}

Tomorrow is {arialbld}D DAY{arial}, you will land on the Fromench coast at {arialbld}"T TIME"{arial}{pause}

Your objective is {arialbld}Trouville.{arial} You must take back the city and hold it. Karlo von Tekton shouldn't cause you too much trouble, the brains back at the strategic centre see him as the weak link.{pause}

But we're going to have the rest of the family on our back. Tankred and his limp leg are in the south at {arialbld}La Rochelle,{arial} where he's maintaining his silly U-boats. That will be your second objective.{pause}

As for me, I'll deal with chrome-plated eggheaded Otton and his heavy tank breeding at {arialbld}Nancy{arial}, due east.{pause}


I won't say goodbye {rank}, I'll say you "merde", it's supposed to bring you luck in Fromench!{pause}


{offset50}Commander of the 4th Schyzo Army

{arialbld}Kurt Rorscham{arial}



